<Base title="About RapidFix Plumbing" description="Learn more about RapidFix's certified engineering team." breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/portfolio-sites/' }, { label: 'RapidFix Plumbing', href: '/portfolio-sites/demos/service-business/' }, { label: 'About' }]}>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-6 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-200">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">A modern plumbing team built in Manchester</h1>
    <p>RapidFix Plumbing was founded by siblings Asha and Imran Malik after seeing too many residents let down by unreliable trades. We combine fully certified engineers with a digital support team who send live updates, manage paperwork, and track performance.</p>
    <p>Every engineer holds Gas Safe, WaterSafe, and unvented hot water qualifications. Our vans are stocked with WRAS-approved parts and IoT sensors for leak detection. We work with landlords, letting agents, facilities managers, and homeowners across Greater Manchester.</p>
    <p>We offset vehicle emissions, recycle old boilers responsibly, and donate a day each month to community repairs.</p>
